        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alfred Santell, David Fincher, Aaron Hoffman\n- Works: Beloved Rogues\n- Roles: film director, film producer, writer\n- Places: San Francisco, California\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Santell was born on September 14, 1895, in San Francisco, California.\n- Alfred Santell, also known as Al Santell, was an American film director and film producer.\n- Beloved Rogues is a 1917 American silent comedy-drama film.\n- Beloved Rogues was directed and written by Alfred Santell.\n- Aaron Hoffman created the storyline for Beloved Rogues.\n- David Fincher was born on August 28, 1962.\n- David Fincher is an American director and producer known for films, television series, and music videos.",
